# Excluded from `quarto use template`: agent guidance and dev tooling belong to this repo as the
# baseline's own workspace, not to an adopting institution's project.
.claude/
.pi/
CLAUDE.md
_dev/
_site/
docs/
./deviations.qmd

# The test suite. Underscore-prefixed so Quarto's `**/_*` glob never renders its fixtures as pages,
# but that glob governs rendering only — `quarto use template` honours nothing of the sort, and
# Quarto's built-in template excludes cover `.*` and `_extensions`, not `_*`. Without this line the
# whole suite is copied into every adopting institution's project.
_tests/

# An adoption decision is this project's, not an adopter's. Inheriting it would plant a real
# approver's name and date against a decision they never made, and silently drop a policy
# document from their ISMS. The README carries the example instead.
_isms.yml
